data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHBA ATSUSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUZUNO KASEI KABUSHIKI KAISHA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHBA, ATSUSHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUZUNO KASEI KABUSHIKI KAISHA</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHBA ATSUSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHBA, ATSUSHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A double-purpose make-up material container serving as a container containing liquid make-up material and a container containing bar-shaped make-up material which deliverably stores bar-like make-up material, comprising a relay device which is capable of freely opening and closing a container main body and screwed into the container main body into which liquid make-up material is filled, a bar-like center shaft which has a coating device inserted into the container main body and fixed to the relay device, and a delivery mechanism which axially moves a lever body connecting a tip tube rotatably to the relay device and holding the bar-like make-up material inserted slidably into the tip cylinder according to the rotation of the relay device and the tip cylinder.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un contenant de produit de maquillage, double usage, servant en tant que contenant d'un produit de maquillage liquide et en tant que contenant d'un produit de maquillage sous forme de bâtonnet, conservant ce bâtonnet de manière à pouvoir le faire sortir. Ce contenant comprend un dispositif relais, lequel permet d'ouvrir et de fermer librement un corps principal du contenant et est vissé dans ce corps rempli du produit de maquillage liquide, un axe central du type tige, doté d'un élément de revêtement inséré dans le corps principal et fixé au dispositif relais, ainsi qu'un mécanisme de distribution déplaçant de manière axiale un levier, lequel relie un tube d'extrémité monté rotatif sur le dispositif relais et supporte le produit de maquillage en bâtonnet inséré coulissant dans le cylindre d'extrémité en fonction de la rotation du dispositif relais et du cylindre d'extrémité.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>